'''Winter's Edge''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.      

== Appearance ==
Its blade, colored in different shades of blue, is shaped like a giant sharp icicle. It has no guard, meaning that the handle is attached to the bottom of the blade. The handle itself is red in color with a yellow ring around it, along with a dark turquoise pointed flame pommel attached to the bottom of it.

== Trivia ==
* Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/93136666/Sword-of-the-Seven-Winters Sword of the Seven Winters], purchasable from the avatar shop for 725 Robux.
* It is shown in the preview of the [[Knife Wrapper]] effect, but wrapped in green wrapping paper. It is the only [[Godly Weapons|godly]] shown in an effect preview as it normally uses a [[Default Knife]] as an example.
* It has a similar throw animation as [[Deathshard]], [[Chroma Deathshard]], [[Chroma Fang]], and [[Fang]].
*When salvaged, it provides 22 godly [[shards]].

